00:06:53.736 --> 00:07:00.936
Together those two ensure that the prediction for position i
can only depend on positions before i.

00:07:02.286 --> 00:07:06.438
The masking is done inside attention rather than around it.

00:07:06.888 --> 00:07:17.544
Before the softmax, every score connecting a query to a later
